"P47323689" "Stay away from {HeroName}... {Hero.gender=male he's|she's} bad luck. I heard that if you talk to {Hero.gender=male him|her}, the Tsoo will attack you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
